lympic champion. Like the 400 Coventry opened up a lead but was pegged back and overtaken by Rice in the closing stages. This was the second of Rice’s three Olympic gold medals and the third silver medal won by Coventry in Beijing. " [:a {:href "/athletes/103301"} "Natalie Coughlin"] ", who had made a last minute to race this event at the US trials, finished ahead of Hoff for the bronze medal."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/112288"} "Steph Rice"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AUS.png"}] "AUS"]] [:td {} "2:12.07 (2 h5)"] [:td {} "2:10.58 (2 h1)"] [:td {} "2:08.45 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/94046"} "Kirsty Coventry"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ZIM"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ZIM.png"}] "ZIM"]] [:td {} "2:12.18 (3 h5)"] [:td {} "2:09.53 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "2:08.59 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/103301"} "Natalie Coughlin"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "2:11.63 (1 h3)"] [:td {} "2:11.84 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "2:10.34 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/103232"} "Katie Hoff"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; 